{"id":638,"gn":"Pokémon Cœur de Fer","ft":["Un Pokémon légendaire qui a combattu les humains pour protéger les Pokémon. Il est d’un naturel calme et posé.","Il possède un corps et un cœur de fer. Il peut mater les Pokémon les plus agressifs d’un simple regard.","Un corps et un cœur en acier trempé, jadis au service de la défense des Pokémon blessés par les humains.","Selon la légende, il aurait défié les Hommes, aux côtés de Terrakium et de Viridium, pour protéger les Pokémon d’Unys.","Dès la naissance, il a un air de chef. Même le plus terrible des adversaires file doux face à lui."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":1,"24":2,"25":1,"26":2,"33":3,"34":4},"tt":["Il a un corps et un cœur d'acier. Il a travaillé avec ses alliés pour punir les gens quand ils ont blessé Pokémon."],"tv":{"21":0,"22":0},"gr":-1,"cr":3,"hc":80,"bh":35,"eg":["Inconnu"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"zadlc":[0,115],"swcrown":[0,205],"sw":[2,205],"b2w2":[0,225],"bw":[0,144]},"f":{"638":{"n":"Cobaltium","t":["steel","fighting"],"s":[91,90,129,90,72,108],"h":2.1,"w":250,"a":[[154,0]],"av":["zadlc","swcrown","sw","b2w2","bw"],"ls":[{"l":[[98,1],[43,1],[270,1],[526,1],[232,7],[501,14],[24,21],[514,28],[368,35],[36,42],[533,49],[14,56],[442,63],[370,70]],"m":[14,63,86,115,129,156,164,173,179,182,184,201,203,206,214,219,224,263,269,270,276,279,280,334,340,347,370,398,403,404,411,416,428,430,442,444,446,496,514,521,526,684],"t":[796,811]},{"l":[[98,1],[43,1],[24,7],[232,13],[36,19],[270,25],[514,31],[442,37],[533,42],[14,49],[501,55],[526,61],[368,67],[370,73]],"m":[14,15,46,63,70,86,92,104,115,156,164,182,201,206,207,216,218,219,237,244,249,263,269,332,347,397,398,404,411,416,430,444,468,496,514,521,526],"t":[173,214,270,276,334,335,340,393,428,442,446]},{"l":[[98,1],[43,1],[24,7],[232,13],[36,19],[270,25],[514,31],[442,37],[533,42],[14,49],[501,55],[526,61],[368,67],[370,73]],"m":[14,15,46,63,70,86,92,104,115,156,164,182,201,206,207,216,218,219,237,244,249,263,269,332,347,397,398,404,411,416,430,444,468,496,514,521,52